```comment
T1053.005 - Scheduled Task/Job: Scheduled Task
```

```comment
SEARCH A (validated): Sysmon process creation, schtasks.exe creating a task.
Observed in lab: schtasks /create /tn LabTask /tr notepad.exe /sc daily /st 09:00, launched from powershell.exe.
```
index=sysmon EventCode=1 Image="*\\schtasks.exe" CommandLine="*/create*"
| table _time host User ParentImage CommandLine


```comment
SEARCH A-RISK (UNTESTED): flags tasks that run as SYSTEM or fire at logon/startup, which are more suspicious.
```
index=sysmon EventCode=1 Image="*\\schtasks.exe" CommandLine="*/create*"
| eval cl=lower(CommandLine)
| eval runs_as_system=if(like(cl,"%/ru system%"),"yes","no")
| eval trigger_logon_or_startup=if(like(cl,"%/sc onlogon%") OR like(cl,"%/sc onstart%"),"yes","no")
| table _time host User ParentImage CommandLine runs_as_system trigger_logon_or_startup


```comment
SEARCH B (UNTESTED / NOT CAPTURED): Security 4698, a scheduled task was created.
Only present if "Other Object Access Events" auditing is enabled:
  auditpol /set /subcategory:"Other Object Access Events" /success:enable
```
index=wineventlog EventCode=4698
| table _time host Message
